# Author                :       Nitin Prabhakar
# Description           :       This is the script to collect charge for TOD availment.
# Input                 :       Account Id, ChargeEventID, ChargingAcctSol, ChargingAcctCrncy
# Output                :       None
# Called Script         :       None
# Calling Script        :       ctodadp007.scr
#
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----        ----------         --------------    ----------------        ---------
#  1           26-04-2013         Nitin Prabhakar   original Version          1.0
#   2		21-08-2013	Priya K		  Modified for TO:367198	2.0
